COMMENT this is my (lewibs) keyboard layout that I like to use for programming in C flavor languages

INJECT colors.kf
INJECT keys.kf

COMMENT defined these here because they are specific to ZSA and i didnt want ZSA specific things in a global file.
KEY m_ac_0 KC_MS_ACCEL0 c_yellow
KEY m_ac_1 KC_MS_ACCEL1 c_yellow
KEY m_ac_2 KC_MS_ACCEL2 c_yellow

COMMENT masking works by putting the rightmost element over the left one, this means mac stuff must be on the right of what they are masking!
KEYBOARD LAYOUT_planck_grid MATRIX_ROWS MATRIX_COLS RGB_MATRIX_LED_COUNT _base _mac _symbols _math _delete _mac_delete _mouse _mouse_mac _fn _macro

KEY d_line LCTL LSFT del c_red
KEY d_word LCTL del c_red
KEY dm_word LALT del c_red
KEY b_word LCTL bac c_red
KEY bm_word LALT bac c_red
KEY b_line LCTL LSFT bac c_red
KEY w_left LCTL left c_pink
KEY wm_left LGUI left c_pink
KEY w_right RCTL right c_pink
KEY wm_right LGUI right c_pink


KEY m_find LGUI space c_yellow
KEY copy LCTL c c_orange
KEY paste LCTL v c_orange
KEY m_copy LGUI c c_orange
KEY m_paste LGUI v c_orange

KEY fn MO _fn c_yellow
KEY syms MO _symbols c_yellow
KEY nums MO _math c_yellow
KEY mouse MO _mouse c_yellow
KEY macro MO _macro c_yellow
KEY mac TG _mac c_orange
KEY MASK m_mouse _mouse _mouse_mac c_orange

KEY COMBO 2 _symbols _math _delete
KEY COMBO 3 _mac _symbols _math _mac_delete

STRING print System.out.println(
KEY MACRO m_pnt print c_cyan

STRING for for
KEY MACRO m_for for c_cyan
STRING while while
KEY MACRO m_while while c_cyan
STRING const const
KEY MACRO m_const const c_cyan
STRING else else
KEY MACRO m_else else c_cyan
STRING brew brew
KEY MACRO m_brew brew c_cyan

STRING elif else if
KEY MACRO m_elif elif c_cyan

LAYER _base
q       w       e       r       t       del     bac      y       u       i       o       p
a       s       d       f       g       '       tab      h       j       k       l       ;
z       x       c       v       b       esc     enter    n       m       ,       .       /
ctl     alt     fn      sft     syms    space   SKIP     nums    mouse   macro   os      ctl

LAYER _mac
TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS
TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS
TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS 
cmd     opt     TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   SKIP    TRANS   m_mouse TRANS   m_find  ctl

LAYER _macro
no      m_while m_else  no      no      TRANS   TRANS    no      no      m_elif  no      m_pnt            
no      no      no      m_for   no      `       TRANS    no      no      no      no      no          
no      no      m_const no      m_brew  TRANS   TRANS    no      no      no      no      no        
TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   SKIP     TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS

LAYER _symbols
no      no      no      no      no      TRANS   TRANS    no      !       {       }       @            
no      no      no      no      no      `       TRANS    no      #       (       )       $           
no      no      no      no      no      TRANS   TRANS    no      |       [       ]       &          
TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   SKIP     TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS

LAYER _math
0       1       2       3       no      TRANS   TRANS    no      %       ~       \       no
.       4       5       6       no      `       TRANS    no      -       +       /       *         
=       7       8       9       no      calc    TRANS    no      no      <       >       ^         
TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   SKIP     TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS

LAYER _delete
no      no      no      no      no      TRANS   TRANS    no      no      no      no       no
no      no      d_word  del     no      no      TRANS    no      bac     b_word  no       no
no      no      no      no      no      TRANS   TRANS    no      no      no      no       no
TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   SKIP     TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS    TRANS
COMMENT in mac mode the above is macked by the below
LAYER _mac_delete
TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS
TRANS   TRANS   dm_word TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   bm_word TRANS   TRANS
TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS
TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   SKIP    TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS    TRANS

LAYER _mouse
no      r_clk    m_up    l_clk   paste   TRANS   TRANS    m_ac_2  l_clk   up      r_clk   no
no      m_left   m_down  m_right copy    no      TRANS    w_left  left    down    right   w_right
p_left  p_up     no      p_down  p_right TRANS   TRANS    home    no      no      no      end
TRANS   TRANS    TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   SKIP     TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS
COMMENT in mac mode is above is masked by the below
LAYER _mouse_mac
TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   m_paste TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS
TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   m_copy  TRANS   TRANS   wm_left TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   wm_right
p_right p_down  no      p_up    p_left  TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS
TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   SKIP    TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS

LAYER _fn
f1      f2      f3      f4      f5      f6      f7      f8      f9      f10     f11     f12
no      no      no      no      no      no      brt-    brt+    p_song  n_song  no      vol_m
mac     no      no      no      no      no      no      no      vol-    vol+    no      pause 
TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   SKIP    TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS   TRANS

